  "prompt": "A wellness platform tracks users' daily sleep records in a table called sleep_logs. Each row has a target_hours goal and actual_hours slept. Management wants to populate an achievement_status column based on performance: set it to 'exceeded' if actual hours are at least 110% of target, 'met' if at least 100% but under 110%, 'partial' if at least 50% but under 100%, and 'missed' if under 50%. Write a single UPDATE statement that sets achievement_status for all rows according to these rules, then write a SELECT statement ordered by log_id to confirm the results.",
